    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/eabf7657f105afaf102d34706945dbf5.poster.avif?t=1752611746\" width=618 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/eabf7657f105afaf102d34706945dbf5.webm?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/eabf7657f105afaf102d34706945dbf5.mp4?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/a9264ebddd6cf2990db6ced9cdd48ff2.webp?t=1752611746\" width=618 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious British village hiding a sinister secret, using extra-sensory abilities to unearth hidden truths and face supernatural threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/073b9bea8e27dcdd66555d016950eaaf.poster.avif?t=1752611746\" width=618 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/073b9bea8e27dcdd66555d016950eaaf.webm?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/073b9bea8e27dcdd66555d016950eaaf.mp4?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/e90606a22569bac7b1535cd2e5342a4d.avif?t=1752611746\" width=618 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grace, a young woman with the ability to sense and interact with spirits, is drawn to Woodside after suffering terrifying and invasive nightmares about her family and their connection to the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After setting out to investigate Woodside in an attempt to free herself from its grasp, Grace is faced with supernatural horrors as she struggles to reconcile with her abilities, her past and her future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/46195d9419cdb4842cfd7a0ff63e2b9c.avif?t=1752611746\" width=618 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RICH EXPLORATION</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover vital clues by interacting with the environment to learn more about Woodside and its history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate eerie locations in a detailed representation of rural England.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow spirits to unveil hidden areas and secrets lurking within the village.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through exploration and investigation, you'll learn more about the people the entities you face used to be - discovering not only what made them monsters, but what made them human. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/2f463ef92684634b9b80fb89edb68db8.poster.avif?t=1752611746\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/2f463ef92684634b9b80fb89edb68db8.webm?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/2f463ef92684634b9b80fb89edb68db8.mp4?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC HAUNTINGS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Woodside, spirits are reactive and autonomous, deciding for themselves when to make their presence known.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hauntings are driven by player action and the personality of each spirit, offering a unique experience in every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/b8f9c799042f5f704f4746e691ab23cd.poster.avif?t=1752611746\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/b8f9c799042f5f704f4746e691ab23cd.webm?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/b8f9c799042f5f704f4746e691ab23cd.mp4?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KNOWLEDGE IS POWER</strong><br>The more you learn about the supernatural entities in Woodside, the greater your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>THIRD-PERSON EXPLORATION</strong><br>Is something watching you? Navigate in third-person, fixed-camera perspective as you explore an eerily quiet village in rural England.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/bd0908beb5ef97bfe2ddc06233d4bf61.poster.avif?t=1752611746\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/bd0908beb5ef97bfe2ddc06233d4bf61.webm?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/bd0908beb5ef97bfe2ddc06233d4bf61.mp4?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FIRST-PERSON ENCOUNTERS</strong><br>Investigate abandoned homes and buildings in close-up, first-person perspective,  confronting spirits in heart-pounding face-to-face encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/b0bfb82e8888efa5909b8e4f7a6e8905.poster.avif?t=1752611746\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/b0bfb82e8888efa5909b8e4f7a6e8905.webm?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/b0bfb82e8888efa5909b8e4f7a6e8905.mp4?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/37e81f01ab89c6ec1c13d92752805358.poster.avif?t=1752611746\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/37e81f01ab89c6ec1c13d92752805358.webm?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/37e81f01ab89c6ec1c13d92752805358.mp4?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br> <strong>AN IMMERSIVE AND UNCANNY WORLD</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an atmospheric and visually immersive world through richly detailed, familiar, yet otherworldly, environments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an evocative and haunting original score that will stay with you long after you leave Woodside.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1752611746\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614270/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1752611746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
